flowchart TB
    Gateway["E-Wallet Sandbox / Demo Fallback"]
    Seller["Seller"]

    P31(("3.1 Verify Signature\n& Log Webhook"))
    P32(("3.2 Idempotency Check\n(finalizePayment)"))
    P33(("3.3 Conditional Atomic\nStock Decrement"))
    P34(("3.4 Flag Stock Conflict\n& Block Shipping"))
    P41(("4.1 Seller Fulfilment\nUpdate"))

    D3[("D3 Orders & Order Items")]
    D2[("D2 Product Variants")]
    D4[("D4 Webhook Events & Payments")]
    D5[("D5 Audit Logs")]

    Gateway -->|POST /webhook or /simulate| P31
    P31 -->|Invalid Signature: 401 + Log| D4
    P31 -->|Valid| P32
    P32 -->|Already PAID: No-op| D3
    P32 -->|PENDING| P33
    P33 -->|stock >= qty: Decrement| D2
    P33 -->|count == 0: Last Pair Taken| P34
    P34 -->|stock_conflict = true| D3
    P34 -->|Audit Event| D5
    P33 -->|Mark PAID + Record Payment| D3

    Seller -->|Mark Slice SHIPPED| P41
    P41 -->|Verify PAID & No Conflict| D3
    P41 -->|Update Item & Derive Order Status| D3
